  "bio": "Step into the creative enclave of Ybor City Tattoo Company, nestled in the heart of Tampa, where illustrative genius meets timeless traditional design. Our resident artists—@space.caked, @trailer_mullet, @stabbedintheblack, @r2tat2, and @joshschellenberg—bring your visions to life with masterful precision and a splash of local flair. Experience a studio where artistry is celebrated, and every tattoo is a bespoke masterpiece tailored to your narrative."
